### Pure Domain Logic: Lockout & Throttle Invariant
$$\text{isLockedOut}(u) = (u.\text{lockoutEnd} \neq \text{null}) \land (u.\text{lockoutEnd} > \text{currentTime})$$
$$\text{recordFailedAttempt}(u): u.\text{accessFailedCount} \leftarrow u.\text{accessFailedCount} + 1$$
$$\text{if } u.\text{accessFailedCount} \ge 5 \implies u.\text{lockoutEnd} \leftarrow \text{currentTime} + 15\text{min}$$

