## 5. Risk Assessment & Rollback Protocols
| Risk Description | Severity | Mitigation Strategy | Rollback Action |
|---|---|---|---|
| Incompatible password hash calculation locks out existing users | Critical | Verify against 100 test hash fixtures from legacy database before rollout | Immediate gateway route revert to legacy controller |
| Session cookie format incompatible with downstream legacy apps | High | Maintain legacy cookie encryption key and format during Phase 3 | Repoint gateway to legacy endpoint |
```

